1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,083
In a short time, a volume V of fluid is pushed in at the lower end, and an equal volume leaves at the top.

2
00:00:07,083 --> 00:00:10,104
The pressure behind does work P one V on it.

3
00:00:10,104 --> 00:00:13,580
Work P two V is done against the pressure ahead.

4
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:17,721
The net work is P one minus P two, times V.

